Third-party notices for macwin
==============================

1. Chromium keycode table
-------------------------

crates/macwin-core/src/keymap/generated.rs is generated by tools/keymap-gen
from Chromium's ui/events/keycodes/dom/dom_code_data.inc, which is checked in
unmodified as tools/keymap-gen/data/dom_code_data.inc. The derived data are the
USB HID usage, Windows scan code, macOS virtual key code and DOM code columns
of that table.

