2. Rust crate dependencies
--------------------------

The Rust crates macwin depends on carry their own license files. The licenses
allowed in the dependency graph are enforced by deny.toml (cargo-deny).

3. Fonts in the MacWin window
-----------------------------

The window (crates/macwin-ui) is drawn with egui, which embeds three fonts from
the epaint_default_fonts crate (version 0.37.0) in the macwin binaries:

- Ubuntu-Light.ttf: "Copyright 2011 Canonical Ltd. Licensed under the Ubuntu
  Font Licence 1.0" (licence text A below).
- Hack-Regular.ttf: Copyright (c) 2018 Source Foundry Authors / Copyright (c)
  2003 by Bitstream, Inc. All Rights Reserved. (license texts B below).
- egui-icons.ttf: a subset of emoji-icon-font.ttf
  (https://github.com/jslegers/emoji-icon-font) with five icons, under its MIT
  License (C below).

The license texts are copied verbatim from the crate's fonts folder.

